In this chapter now the authors teaches us how to access a file, write it and do good practices by opening and closing files by using a with loop.  

Concepts of Data Streams are mentioned. Incoming data streams (downstream) and written to outgoing data stream (upstream) 

Example of opening a file: qerqw = open("python.txt", "r")

Example using with statement: 
